{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Monkey love banana,  how many can you feed?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bananaganza is a minimalist, casual arcade game where the only thing that matters is <i>bananas</i>. Forget the corporate grind for a while and focus on something that truly matters: collecting delicious banana slices.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Warning, it is more challenging that you might think! Are you ready for the banana beatdown?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3776630/extras/357443708f9389fee645a76206cc6667.poster.avif?t=1765259661\" width=600 height=166 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3776630/extras/357443708f9389fee645a76206cc6667.webm?t=1765259661\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3776630/extras/357443708f9389fee645a76206cc6667.mp4?t=1765259661\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Peel. Slice. Collect. Repeat.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Bananaganza, your ultimate mission is simple: collect as many banana slices as possible. But beware, not all bananas are created equal, and the rotten ones could ruin your fruity fun.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Here\u2019s what you\u2019ll be doing in Bananaganza:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf4c Peel bananas. <br>\ud83c\udf4c Slice them into perfect pieces.<br>\ud83c\udf4c Catch the flying banana slices before they escape.<br>\ud83c\udf4c Dodge the rotten bananas.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3776630/extras/48efaa79aef23ed4de5101f980408482.poster.avif?t=1765259661\" width=600 height=166 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3776630/extras/48efaa79aef23ed4de5101f980408482.webm?t=1765259661\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3776630/extras/48efaa79aef23ed4de5101f980408482.mp4?t=1765259661\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bananaganza is lovingly hand-crafted (AI-free) by a solo indie developer whose top life goals are creating fun but small games. Every banana in this game was made with the hope of brightening your day.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Complete Banana Breeze","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3776630/5873d0465ddff5c376ec273cf8f5ac19f80a6434.jpg"},{"name":"Complete Banana Gust","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3776630/c6bf6e6689c6c57349fc284034e99b0f61c3f2c0.jpg"},{"name":"Complete Banana Storm","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3776630/18c5ed7f893ce5e776d91cb72b99173a0d53299e.jpg"},{"name":"Banana Bread","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3776630/15b30bbbb14cf01462f3d73f0330ccb17b623afd.jpg"},{"name":"Feeder of Monkeys","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3776630/9032b5099594d096c6a22d211f2793b33589e2ed.jpg"},{"name":"Monkeyganza!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3776630/0b20409fd168159d06aee8a2be480a2e998e2df9.jpg"},{"name":"Apprentice Banana Gatherer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3776630/0e277cdaa84f2db5c49075e60b69e4b2f4a95803.jpg"},{"name":"Banana Master","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3776630/85b936dbbf63a54d3d1da08e056cb06136d65a69.jpg"},{"name":"Bananaganza!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.